2026-07-28T21:34:28.6788817Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-28T21:34:28.6888947Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-28T21:34:28.6889431Z i C:\Users\RUNNER~1\AppData\Local\Temp\RtmpuwtEa6/duckdb
2026-07-28T21:34:28.6889727Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-28T21:34:28.6889998Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-28T21:34:28.6890231Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-28T21:34:28.6890571Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-28T21:34:28.6891083Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-28T21:34:28.6891461Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
